message: "If you use Aegis, please cite it as below."
title: "Aegis — Q&A Defense Kit for Medical Presentations (QA 防禦術)"
abstract: >-
  A Claude skill that prepares oncology and hematology speakers for audience questions:
  MECE question sweep across five branches and five questioner personas, simulation of
  AI-generated answers and their blind spots, Cynefin triage, Argdown claim maps, and
  first-principles answers with sourced numbers and doses, built into HTML, PPTX and PDF.
